# .easignore — controls which files EAS Build uploads (used INSTEAD of .gitignore).
#
# Mirror of .gitignore, EXCEPT it does NOT ignore google-services.json:
# that file is gitignored (kept out of the PUBLIC repo for hygiene) but the
# Android build needs it (Google Sign-In + FCM via expo-notifications). This
# lets EAS upload it for the build without committing it to git.
# Keep this in sync with .gitignore when adding new secret-exclusion patterns.

# E2E 스크린샷 (테스트 실행 시 자동 생성)
e2e/screenshots/*.png
e2e/screenshots/*.jpg

# Dependencies
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# Expo
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
*.jks
*.p8
*.p12
*.key
*.mobileprovision
*.orig.*
*.apk
*.aab
*.ipa

# Native
ios/Pods/
android/build/
android/app/build/
android/.gradle/

